      "explanation": "The epic_id value is now cast to int before being interpolated into the raw SQL string, preventing malicious payloads from being injected. The table name is derived from model metadata and is not user\u2011controlled. Although raw string formatting is still used, the integer conversion eliminates injection risk.",
